        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Developmental-math reforms should show statistically persuasive long-term outcomes before broad expansion.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "DCMP’s randomized five-year follow-up found neither its credential-or-enrollment difference nor its credit difference statistically significant, while reporting a positive net social cost. Its reported lower cost per attainment is source arithmetic built on the non-significant outcome difference, so it is countervailing context rather than confirmed evidence of savings.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
